     "content_html": "governor of Arkansas who sent the National Guard in to stop the Little Rock Nine from attending Central High School"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173488,
     "content_html": "lead attorney for the NAACP’s legal team in the <i>Brown</i> case"
    },
    {
     "id": 1173485,
     "content_html": "federal judge who tried to block the National Guard from preventing the Little Rock Nine from entering Central High School"
    }
